          "type": "prose",
          "header": "A note from the team",
          "body": "Dear Anvil families,\n\nOur Fall Retreat is this week, October 28-30, and we are looking forward to being together! We are praying for three days of adventure, meaningful conversations, and time to grow in faith and brotherhood. We hope this will be a chance for you to step away from the usual routine, be present with one another, and make memories and commitments that you carry home.\n\nThis short guide has what you need to arrive ready. We cannot wait to see you at Woodlands!\n\n*The Anvil Academy Team*"
